奴中改作單于殺之。","references":[{"title":"《史記·匈奴列傳》單于承接","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷110&oldid=8735645","quote":"後頃之，冒頓死，子稽粥立，號曰老上單于。","image_verified":false},{"title":"《史記·匈奴列傳》單于承接","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷110&oldid=8735645","quote":"老上稽粥單于初立，孝文皇帝復遣宗室女公主爲單于閼氏，使宦者燕人中行說傅公主。說不欲行，漢彊使之。說曰：「必我行也，爲漢患者。」中行說既至，因降單于，單于甚親幸之。","image_verified":false},{"title":"《史記·匈奴列傳》單于承接","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷110&oldid=8735645","quote":"後四歳，老上稽粥單于死，子軍臣立爲單于。既立，孝文皇帝復與匈奴和親。而中行說復事之。","image_verified":false}],"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli","source_id":"s-shiji-097-luli"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m020-0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"7wk_awi_f4x","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p020","chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m020-0131","start":131,"end":133,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"7wk_awi_f4x","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p020","chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji097-038","person_id":"7wk_awi_f4x","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-097-luli"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["單于"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p020","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/097.json"}],"rationale":"按酈生、陸賈與朱建分傳及敘事承接限定異稱；尉他尉佗原字分存。平原君據明示朱建另候選；朱建兩處未名子依古注另存暫定同指，淮陰侯與韓信同指另列證據。引語古王及神話人物與當事人分開。"}],"equiva